                "loc": "MRK.14.32+MRK.14.33+MRK.14.34+MRK.14.35+MRK.14.36+MRK.14.37+MRK.14.38+MRK.14.39+MRK.14.40+MRK.14.41+MRK.14.42"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mk. 14.32-42",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.22.39+LUK.22.40+LUK.22.41+LUK.22.42+LUK.22.43+LUK.22.44+LUK.22.45+LUK.22.46"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Lk. 22.39-46",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mu bulamu bwewe khu sibala Yesu asabanga Wele mu khulila khukali ne kamasika, Wele owaba nanyala khumuonia niye khukhwama mu lifwa. Sikila khukhwiboombia ne khukhwirusia khwewe, Wele aamuulila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali akhaba ne aba Omwana owa Wele, eeyika khuba omuriani khubirira mu khupisibwa siibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga akholwa omwichufu, ekela lirakikha lie buonia bwe mwikulu khwaabo boosi bamuria niye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mala Wele amura niye khuba Omusaayi Omukhulu Lukali bulayi bwene nga Melikisedeki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Likaambila khukaania khukhwanjukha lisuubila",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaliio kamakali niko khukhoyeele khuloma khuloondekhana ne likhuwa lino, ne kakhali lili litinyu khuliinoosia khwinywe, sikila muli kalaa lukali khumanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.3.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bakor. 3.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Luno luri andi enywe muli babekisia, ne kakhali mu sienya omundu amwekisie enywe kamekisio ke khunyoa ke burume bwa Wele. Mwalekhile khulia biakhulia biaandalafu, mu siili busa khu mabeele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesi yesi osiinywa kamabeele asiili omwana, se amanyile sisiindu siosi siosi mumakhuwa ke buluungi namwe bubi tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HEB 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu ngila ekiindi biakhulia biaandalafu bili bie babaandu bakhulu, khubirira mu khwenasia banyala khukhwabukhasia kamalayi ne kamabi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HEB.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HEB.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
